{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37180","headline":"严塘经乱书事 一 · 郑啓","name":"严塘经乱书事 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尘生宫阙雾蒙蒙，万骑龙飞幸蜀中。\n在野傅岩君不梦，乘轩卫懿鹤何功。\n虽知四海同盟久，未合中原武备空。\n星落夜原妖气满，汉家麟阁待英雄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑啓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}